{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnDatum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnDatum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnTrace","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.SkeinDatum","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Block","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.NonsingularInverse"],"declarations":57,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.datum_T","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.datum_T","kind":"theorem","line":468,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L468-L468","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.datum_S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.datum_S","kind":"theorem","line":466,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L466-L466","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.datum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.datum","kind":"def","line":455,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L455-L464","doc":"**The `GL_n` vector representation is an oriented skein datum** in `ModuleCat R`, for every\n`n`, with `t = q^n` and `δ = [n]_q`: Brundan's relations (1)–(5) for `E = F = R^n`,\n`S = Ř`, `T` the inverse of the sideways crossing, and the standard cup and cap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.dim_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.dim_eq","kind":"theorem","line":442,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L442-L451","doc":"**Relation (5)**: `t · (ε ∘ T ∘ η) = δ · 1` with `t = q^n` and `δ = [n]_q = ∑_i q^{n-1-i} qi^i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.loopT_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.loopT_apply","kind":"theorem","line":432,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L432-L440","doc":"The closed loop with the mixed crossing: `ε ∘ T ∘ η = ∑_c (A⁻¹ 1)_c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_T","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_T","kind":"theorem","line":412,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L412-L430","doc":"**Relation (4), second half**: `sideways Ř ≫ T = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.T_sideways","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.T_sideways","kind":"theorem","line":392,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L392-L410","doc":"**Relation (4), first half**: `T ≫ sideways Ř = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.Tm_ee","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.Tm_ee","kind":"theorem","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L388-L390","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.Tm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.Tm","kind":"def","line":384,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L384-L386","doc":"The mixed crossing `T : F ⊗ E ⟶ E ⊗ F`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tv","kind":"def","line":380,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L380-L382","doc":"`T (e_a ⊗ e_b)`: the swap off the diagonal, `A⁻¹` on the diagonal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_diag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_diag","kind":"theorem","line":363,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L363-L376","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_off","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_off","kind":"theorem","line":352,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L352-L361","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef_apply","kind":"theorem","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L336-L350","doc":"The coefficients of `Ř`: `⟨e_x ⊗ e_y | Ř | e_c ⊗ e_a⟩` is the diagonal coefficient on\n`(x, y) = (c, a)` plus `1` on the swap `(x, y) = (a, c)`, `c ≠ a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_apply","kind":"theorem","line":315,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L315-L334","doc":"**The sideways crossing on basis vectors.**\n`sideways Ř (e_a ⊗ e_b) = ∑_c ∑_x ⟨e_x ⊗ e_b | Ř | e_c ⊗ e_a⟩ · e_c ⊗ e_x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step8","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step8","kind":"theorem","line":308,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L308-L310","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step7","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step7","kind":"theorem","line":305,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L305-L307","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step6","kind":"theorem","line":302,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L302-L304","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step5","kind":"theorem","line":299,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L299-L301","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step4","kind":"theorem","line":296,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L296-L298","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step3","kind":"theorem","line":293,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L293-L295","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step2","kind":"theorem","line":290,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L290-L292","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.step1","kind":"theorem","line":288,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L288-L289","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sideways_eq","kind":"theorem","line":277,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L277-L284","doc":"`sideways S` as an explicit composite of whiskered structure maps. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sum_xv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.sum_xv","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L259-L273","doc":"The total of `x`, rescaled by `q^n`, is the quantum integer `∑_i q^{n-1-i} qi^i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.Ainv_mulVec_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.Ainv_mulVec_one","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L254-L257","doc":"`A⁻¹ 1 = x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.A_mulVec_xv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.A_mulVec_xv","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L239-L252","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.xv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.xv","kind":"def","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L236-L237","doc":"`x` as a vector on `Fin n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.row_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.row_eq","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L217-L233","doc":"`q x_d + (q - qi) ∑_{d<c<n} x_c = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tail_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tail_top","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L211-L215","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tail_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tail_succ","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L196-L209","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tail","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tail","kind":"def","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L193-L194","doc":"`∑_{d < c < n} x_c`, as a sum over `range n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.xs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.xs","kind":"def","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L190-L191","doc":"`x_c = qi^{2(n-1-c)+1}`, the solution of `A x = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.isUnit_det_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.isUnit_det_A","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L185-L187","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.det_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.det_A","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L181-L183","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.A_blockTriangular","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.A_blockTriangular","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L176-L179","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.A_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.A_apply","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnDatum.lean#L174-L174","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:Q